*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FEE0018
*> PURPOSE : FEE EXEMPTIONS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : R.T.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-09-12 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2009-12-05 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 236
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FEENIGHT STEP020
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FEE0018.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    *> STUDENT INDICATOR Y/N
    05 WS-STU             PIC X.
    *> CUSTOMER AGE IN YEARS
    05 WS-CAGE            PIC 9(3).
01 WS-RESULTS.
    05 WS-FWV             PIC X VALUE 'N'.
        88 FWV-WAIVED VALUE 'Y'.
    *> MONTHLY SERVICE FEE
    05 MF-AMT             PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM FEE-CONCESSION
    DISPLAY "WS-FWV=" WS-FWV
    DISPLAY "MF-AMT=" MF-AMT
    STOP RUN.
FEE-CONCESSION.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        *> STUDENT FEE WAIVER
        WHEN WS-STU = 'Y' AND WS-CAGE < 26
            SET FWV-WAIVED TO TRUE
            MOVE 0 TO MF-AMT
        *> SENIOR FEE WAIVER
        WHEN WS-CAGE >= 60
            SET FWV-WAIVED TO TRUE
            MOVE 0 TO MF-AMT
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 4 TO MF-AMT
    END-EVALUATE.
